## 📊 Galileo Metrics Used

- `hallucination` – Is the model just confidently wrong?
- `instruction_following` – Did it do what it was told?
- `tool_use_accuracy` – Did it call the right function?
- `relevance` – Is the response remotely useful?

> Use these to generate fake business takes:  
> _“Your hallucination score is 85%. But it sounds confident — so investors love it.”_

