## 🧠 Learning Objectives (Disguised as Fun)

| Serious Concept                | In-Game Experience                                         |
|--------------------------------|------------------------------------------------------------|
| Custom evals > generic metrics | “High fluency, zero correctness? Raise seed anyway.”       |
| Hallucination ≠ harmless       | “Model recommended a legal strategy… from a Marvel movie.” |
| Pipeline complexity = risk     | “Why is your memory buffer reciting poetry?”               |
| Eval drift across agents       | “Summarizer contradicts retriever — but who’s checking?”   |

